# The live domain. `next build` reads this file automatically, so the canonical tag, the
# sitemap, robots.txt and the JSON-LD all resolve against the real host without anyone
# having to remember a command-line variable. NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are compiled into the
# page and are public by design — there is nothing secret here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://sakuramachipastries.com
